sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant B as Browser
  participant L as LiveKit room
  participant A as Python agent
  participant M as Moss taxcode index
  U->>B: asks why is my standard deduction this amount
  B->>L: mic audio over WebRTC
  L->>A: audio track for agent-py
  A->>A: Deepgram nova-3 turns speech into text
  A->>M: search_taxcode query top_k 3
  M-->>A: chunks with scores and time_taken_ms
  A->>B: moss_context data message with matches and latency
  B->>B: Knowledge Matches panel updates and PDF jumps to cited page
  alt top score at or above 0.90
    A->>A: LLM answers only from returned text and names the source
  else top score below 0.90
    A->>A: NO_CITATION_FOUND so agent refuses and calls record_concern
  end
  A->>L: MiniMax TTS audio for the reply
  L->>B: spoken answer plays
